"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Jimmy Chew</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"56\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Cat Benatar</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Fleaonce</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n40:[\"$\",\"p\",\"58\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Volcano</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n41:[\"$\",\"p\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Mutt Damon</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n42:[\"$\",\"p\",\"60\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Dog the Bounty Hunter</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n43:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"51–60\"]}]\n44:[\"$\",\"p\",\"62\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Virginia Woof</strong> — A clever twist that suits a smart and mischievous companion who always keeps you laughing.\"}}]\n45:[\"$\",\"p\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Pablo Escobark</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n46:[\"$\",\"p\",\"64\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Princess Leia Organa</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n47:[\"$\",\"p\",\"65\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Brad Pitbull</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n48:[\"$\",\"p\",\"66\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Bark Simpson</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n49:[\"$\",\"p\",\"67\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Barky Balboa</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"68\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Bark Twain</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"69\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Fidel Catstro</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n4c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"70\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Notorious D.O.G.</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n4d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"71\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Catbert Einstein</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"72\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"These 60 names represent a diverse collection spanning multiple styles, origins, and inspirations. Each one has been carefully selected for quality and memorability.\"]}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"73\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🎯 Expert Tips & Best Practices\"]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"p\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>1. Keep It Short:</strong> One to two syllables is ideal. Names like Max, Luna, or Charlie are easy for pets to recognize and for you to say quickly.\"}}]\n51:[\"$\",\"p\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>2. Avoid Command Confusion:</strong> Don't choose names that sound like common commands. \\\"Kit\\\" sounds like \\\"sit,\\\" \\\"Bo\\\" sounds like \\\"no,\\\" and \\\"Fletch\\\" sounds like \\\"fetch.\\\" This can confuse your pet during training.\"}}]\n52:[\"$\",\"p\",\"76\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>3. Consider Longevity:</strong> A name that's cute for a kitten or puppy should still suit a full-grown cat or dog. \\\"Tiny\\\" might be adorable for a puppy but ironic for a 100-pound adult dog.\"}}]\n53:[\"$\",\"p\",\"77\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>4. Test the \\\"Backdoor Test\\\":</strong> Stand at your back door and call the name loudly three times. If you feel embarrassed, keep looking. You'll be doing this regularly!\"}}]\n54:[\"$\",\"p\",\"78\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>5. Use Positive Association:</strong> Always pair the name with positive experiences — treats, pets, play. Never use your pet's name when scolding them.\"}}]\n55:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"79\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"⚠️ Common Mistakes to Avoid\"]}]\n56:[\"$\",\"p\",\"80\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Rushing the Decision:</strong> Take your time. Most new pet owners feel pressure to name their pet immediately, but waiting a few days to understand their personality leads to better choices.\"}}]\n57:[\"$\",\"p\",\"81\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Choosing Names Too Similar to Family Members:</strong> A pet named \\\"Molly\\\" when your daughter's friend is also Molly can create awkward situations. Check that the name doesn't overlap with people in your immediate circle.\"}}]\n58:[\"$\",\"p\",\"82\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Names That Are Hard to Spell or Pronounce:</strong> You'll need to spell your pet's name for vet records, microchip registration, and insurance. X Æ A-12 might be a famous baby name, but it's impractical for daily pet life.\"}}]\n59:[\"$\",\"p\",\"83\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Ignoring Breed Heritage:</strong> A Scottish Terrier named \\\"Haggis\\\" or a Shiba Inu named \\\"Mochi\\\" connects your pet to its breed heritage. Consider names that honor your pet's origins.\"}}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"84\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Explore More Name Ideas\"]}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"85\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Looking for more inspiration? Browse our complete collection of name generators: \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"81\",{\"href\":\"/animal/african-penguin/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"African Penguin\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"106\",{\"href\":\"/animal/blue-tang/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Blue Tang\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"125\",{\"href\":\"/animal/day-gecko/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Day Gecko\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"144\",{\"href\":\"/animal/sphynx-cat/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Sphynx Cat\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, and \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"168\",{\"href\":\"/animal/oriental-shorthair/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Oriental Shorthair\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names. Each generator features 160+ hand-picked names across 9 unique categories including male, female, cute, funny, fantasy, unique, cool, and baby names.\"]}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What celebrity pet names are trending?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Taylor Swift's cats (Meredith Grey, Olivia Benson, Benjamin Button) are hugely influential. Other trending celebrity pet names include Oprah's dogs, Dwayne Johnson's French bulldogs, and Kylie Jenner's Italian greyhounds.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can I name my pet after